textContent.value:
Level 1: if 1,800 beans received, get 450 beans;

Level 2: if 2,500 beans received, get extra 300 beans;

Level 3: if 3,600 beans received, get extra 350 beans;

Level 4: if 4,800 beans received, get extra 400 beans;

Level 5: if 6,000 beans received, get extra 400 beans;

Level 6: if 9,000 beans received, get extra 1,000 beans;

Level 7: if 15,000 beans received, get extra 2,100 beans;

Level 8: if 22,000 beans received, get extra 2,200 beans;

Level 9: if 30,000 beans received, get extra 2,800 beans;

The maximum you can get is 10,000 beans!
